#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2045 mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2070
#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2078 mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2162
#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2187
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
